  "body": "Option 1 – Smart & Stylish\r\n• 3 Bedrooms\r\n• 2 Levels of modern living\r\n• Contemporary kitchen and open-plan living\r\n• Perfect for first home buyers, professionals, or investors \r\n\r\nOption 2 – Spacious Family Living\r\n• 4 Bedrooms\r\n• 2 Levels with internal garage\r\n• Generous open-plan living areas\r\n• Ideal for families wanting space and convenience\r\n\r\nBoth options offer sleek modern finishes, light-filled interiors, and easy-care living, giving you more time to enjoy life and less time on maintenance.\r\n\r\nLocated close to key amenities, transport routes, shopping hubs, and parks, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure a brand new home in a well-connected location.\r\n\r\nBrand new homes in this location are always in demand – don’t miss your chance.\r\n\r\nAct fast – contact us today to arrange a viewing and secure your new home before it’s gone!",
